    234  6380							; ------------------------------------------------------------ One Key Play
    235  6380							; CRSR DOWN or CRSR RIGHT (A = 1 / 2: which) pressed, ONE KEY PLAY on: the
    236  6380							; phrase's next step sounds. PENTATONIC PAIRS: two notes of the key's
    237  6380							; pentatonic scale, one apart (a third or a fourth), across the overlay's two
    238  6380							; octaves. CHORD NOTES: one note of the chord (the keys held or latched),
    239  6380							; over two octaves. EACH PRESS CUTS the last step or lets it RING ON (until
    240  6380							; the next). The notes sound while either key is down (latch: until the next
    241  6380							; press).
    242  6380				   OkpPress
    243  6380					      subroutine
    244  6380		       0d 79 c8 	      ora	okpDown
    245  6383		       8d 79 c8 	      sta	okpDown
